      "observed": "Both FCC1 VCAP pins are connected to the UART3 connector nets, while C13, a 2.2 µF capacitor, is unconnected.",
      "expected": "VCAP pins on the STM32H753 should have the required local core-regulator bypass capacitors and should not be routed as UART signals.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"UART3_RX_FCC\") (node (ref \"FCC1\") (pin \"73\") (pinfunction \"VCAP\")) (node (ref \"UART3_FCC1\") (pin \"4\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
